            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MONIQUE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for a wine tasting party I had. It was really good. I also made a chicken rice soup that was awesome and kind of overshadowed this one. I added a couple of bags of frozen vegetables (chopped broccoli and french cut green beans) which were excellent. Initially it was really bland so I added spices (italian seasoning and lot of course sea salt, celery salt and fresh ground pepper) to give it flavor and that really did the trick. It's a good (maybe not great) recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2011-03-06T10:58:25.140Z"
          },
          {
