            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Rhonda Brock Fuller"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was great, I did make one change. My family doesn't care for the frozen mixed veggies because they don't like everything in them. So, I just added frozen veggies we like. We like carrots, potatoes, corn etc. They cannot stand the green beans. I loved this though and it is added to my stew rotation. And for some reason during the fall and winter I make that a lot.",
            "datePublished": "2006-12-15T15:07:00.533Z"
          },
